{"study_accession":"PRJNA525619","secondary_study_accession":"SRP187529","title":"Human inflammatory mucosal T cells in the female reproductive tract are poised to participate in immunity to infection","description":"The hypothesis is that HIV affects TRM, by decreasing their numbers and possibly affecting their function. In order to be able to analyse several HIV+ and HIV- samples, we would need to identify some markers for TRM that can be used for flow cytometry-based detection of TRM. Overall design: To characterize TRM, we will use a RNA seq approach, in order to identify new markers for CD8+ TRM in human tissues. We will compare CD69+, CD69+ CD103+ and CD69- CD103- populations in the tissue and effector memory T cells, as well as CD69+ T cells in the blood.","pubmed":"31312028","geo_series":"","n_samples":27,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN11054837","study_accession":"PRJNA525619","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"lib26201: Bld PTID 5772 CD8+CD103-CD69+","description":"lib26201: Bld PTID 5772 CD8+CD103-CD69+","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM3639664","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-09-11","attributes":[["source_name","5772"],["tissue","Blood"],["cell_type","CD8+CD69+CD103-"],["cell counts","250"],["hiv_stat","TRUE"],["sex","female"],["flow cell","CBWVTANXX"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR8668882","experiment_accession":"SRX5464887","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":9157546,"base_count":520043578,"first_public":"2019-09-11","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM3639664: lib26201: Bld PTID 5772 CD8+CD103-CD69+ Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN11054839","study_accession":"PRJNA525619","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"lib26194: Bld PTID 5771 CD8+CD103-CD69+","description":"lib26194: Bld PTID 5771 CD8+CD103-CD69+","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM3639657","access":"open"